{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cWhat\u2019s it like to leave your exams behind and head home? But what if \u2018home\u2019 holds more than just the path back?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846920/extras/ee643d23b9aac31a0efc290a85a98b8f.poster.avif?t=1752767781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846920/extras/ee643d23b9aac31a0efc290a85a98b8f.webm?t=1752767781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a worrying phone call, you rush to board the train\u2014only to find that instead of the usual peaceful journey, subtle hints point to something hidden. <strong>Anomaly Express</strong> is a first\u2011person adventure game in which you\u2019ll explore silent compartments and moonlit corridors of a night train to uncover why you\u2019ve been drawn into this mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, you\u2019ll encounter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single\u2011player mode and co\u2011op</strong> for up to 4 players</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric locales</strong>, from the snug kitchen\u2011berth to the abandoned sleeper car;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classical compositions</strong> immersing you in the cozy train\u2011compartment atmosphere;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A gripping story</strong> you can dive into solo or share with friends;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Four close friends</strong>, each with a unique personality yet bound by unbreakable bonds;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A charming visual style</strong> that invites you deeper into the mystery.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846920?t=1752767781","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846920/93f8ae198b26a9d687c0c6e5fb987f0981cf4e06/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752767781","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846920/3e56bbfacab4b0bee6fcc10267a7babad7f851c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752767781","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846920/3e56bbfacab4b0bee6fcc10267a7babad7f851c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752767781","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cWhat\u2019s it like to leave your exams behind and head home? But what if \u2018home\u2019 holds more than just the path back?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846920/extras/ee643d23b9aac31a0efc290a85a98b8f.poster.avif?t=1752767781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846920/extras/ee643d23b9aac31a0efc290a85a98b8f.webm?t=1752767781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a worrying phone call, you rush to board the train\u2014only to find that instead of the usual peaceful journey, subtle hints point to something hidden. <strong>Anomaly Express</strong> is a first\u2011person adventure game in which you\u2019ll explore silent compartments and moonlit corridors of a night train to uncover why you\u2019ve been drawn into this mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_par